{{PageDisplay}}
'''Masteries''' are [[Production Buildings|production building]] boosts such as time, [[coin]]s, or [[experience]] points, which are unlocked as the player uses the building to craft items.

The [[Mine]], the [[Lobster Pool]] and the [[Duck Salon]] are the only production buildings which cannot be mastered.

Masteries are unlocked at [[experience]] level 15.
----

